.TH PKG-INSTALL 1 "October 2026" "SPP Framework" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pkg:install \- Universal Installer for SPP Applications and Modules
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php pkg:install
\fIsourceOrName\fR
[\fB--as=\fIcustomName\fR]
[\fB--scope=\fIsystem|app\fR]
[\fB--app=\fItargetApp\fR]
[\fB--version=\fIversion\fR]
[\fB--repo=\fIrepoNameOrUrl\fR]
[\fB--force\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBpkg:install\fR downloads and installs SPP applications and modules into an existing SPP environment.
It seamlessly resolves packages from the central registry (\fBsatyalab.net\fR), CDNs, GitHub releases,
direct URLs, or local archives, validates SHA-256 signatures, provisions directory trees, and updates system manifests.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \fIsourceOrName\fR
Package name (e.g. 'satyalab/school1'), direct URL, or local archive path.
.TP
.BR --as=\fIcustomName\fR
Override the installed application or module folder name.
.TP
.BR --scope=\fIsystem|app\fR
Module installation scope: system-wide or scoped to a specific application.
.TP
.BR --app=\fItargetApp\fR
Target application identifier for app-level modules.
.TP
.BR --version=\fIversion\fR
Specify target release version. Defaults to latest.
.TP
.BR --repo=\fIrepoNameOrUrl\fR
Repository identifier or URL. Defaults to 'satyalab'.
.TP
.BR --force
Overwrite existing files if the application/module already exists.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
.IP 1.
Downloads package to \fBvar/cache/packages/\fR and verifies cryptographic SHA-256 integrity.
.IP 2.
Extracts files into \fBsrc/\fR, \fBetc/apps/\fR, and \fBresources/\fR (apps) or \fBspp/modules/\fR (modules).
.IP 3.
Registers applications in \fBglobal-settings.yml\fR or modules in \fBmodules.yml\fR.
.IP 4.
Executes automated database migrations and setup routines.
